        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\nRAY COOKE Lettings take great pleasure in introducing this fantastic 1 bed / 1 bath apartment to the letting market in the ever-popular Melville Cove, Finglas, Dublin 11.\nThe property is ideally located close to a host of local amenities including shops, schools, cafés and public transport links. The M50 and N2 are also easily accessible, providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\nBright and spacious living accommodation comprises of entrance hallway, generous living/dining area, fully fitted kitchen, large double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and a main bathroom.\nThe apartment is presented in good condition throughout and boasts a range of features including well-proportioned accommodation, fitted kitchen, ample storage and quality flooring throughout.\nThis property is ideally suited to a wide range of tenants and is sure to attract strong interest. Viewing is highly advised contact Ray Cooke Lettings today to arrange your viewing.\n\nAdditional Features;\n- 1 bed / 1 bath\n- Apartment\n- Fantastic condition throughout\n- Comes fully furnished\n- Top quality windows & doors\n- Top quality fixtures & fittings\n- Top quality flooring\n- Very spacious rooms\n- Luxurious modern fitted wardrobes\n- Top quality blinds\n- Open plan kitchen/dining/living area\n- Fully fitted kitchen\n- Low maintenance balcony\n- Peaceful location\n- Located in the heart of Finglas\n- All local amenities within a short stroll\n- Bus routes on your doorstep\n- Ideal for a wide range of tenants\n- Viewing highly advised\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
      },
